            "value": "OPCJE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default, because it gets in the way while recording the screen. With it on, closing the window leaves the app running in the menu bar instead of quitting, and you can have it leave the Dock as well. Its colours can be stripped too, from the icon's own menu, so it looks like the rest of the menu bar and follows light and dark mode on its own.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default, because it gets in the way while recording the screen. With it on, closing the window leaves the app running in the menu bar instead of quitting, and you can have it leave the Dock as well. Its colours can be stripped too, from the icon's own menu, so it looks like the rest of the menu bar and follows light and dark mode on its own."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Domyślnie wyłączona, bo przeszkadza przy nagrywaniu ekranu. Włączona sprawia, że zamknięcie okna zostawia program w pasku menu zamiast go kończyć — i można wtedy zdjąć go także z Docka. Kolory odbiera się jej w menu samej ikony; wygląda wtedy jak reszta paska i sama trzyma się trybu jasnego i ciemnego."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the list": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the list"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na liście"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the list: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the list: %@"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na liście: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: your apps and windows do not come back after the restart. Off: macOS reopens them, the same as the “Reopen windows when logging back in” checkbox in the system restart dialog.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On: your apps and windows do not come back after the restart. Off: macOS reopens them, the same as the “Reopen windows when logging back in” checkbox in the system restart dialog."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Włączony: programy i okna nie wracają po restarcie. Wyłączony: macOS otwiera je z powrotem, tak samo jak pole „Otwórz ponownie okna przy następnym logowaniu” w systemowym oknie restartu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One thing Change-Boot cannot do for you: macOS puts recently used apps back in the Dock by itself. Turn off “Show suggested and recent apps in Dock” in System Settings → Desktop & Dock, or the icon comes back no matter what this app sets. There is a button for it in Options.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One thing Change-Boot cannot do for you: macOS puts recently used apps back in the Dock by itself. Turn off “Show suggested and recent apps in Dock” in System Settings → Desktop & Dock, or the icon comes back no matter what this app sets. There is a button for it in Options."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jednego Change-Boot nie zrobi za ciebie: macOS sam wstawia do Docka ostatnio używane programy. Wyłącz „Pokazuj sugerowane i ostatnie aplikacje w Docku” w Ustawieniach systemowych → Biurko i Dock, bo inaczej ikona wróci niezależnie od tego, co ustawi ten program. Przycisk do tego stoi w Opcjach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only part of the entry was written.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
