    "Switching": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switching"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przełączanie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching away from this system leaves a one-off login item behind, so Change-Boot is already open when you come back — the moment you usually want to eject the disk you just arrived from. The item removes itself at that start. If you would rather have the app at every login, there is a separate switch for that in Options.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switching away from this system leaves a one-off login item behind, so Change-Boot is already open when you come back — the moment you usually want to eject the disk you just arrived from. The item removes itself at that start. If you would rather have the app at every login, there is a separate switch for that in Options."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przełączenie się stąd zostawia na tym systemie jednorazowy wpis logowania, więc po powrocie Change-Boot jest już otwarty — dokładnie wtedy, gdy zwykle chcesz wysunąć dysk, z którego właśnie przyszedłeś. Wpis zdejmuje się sam przy tym starcie. Jeśli wolisz mieć program przy każdym logowaniu, w Opcjach stoi na to osobny przełącznik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching from here sets a one-off login item on this system. Come back to it and Change-Boot is already open, ready to eject the disk you just arrived from. The item removes itself at that start.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switching from here sets a one-off login item on this system. Come back to it and Change-Boot is already open, ready to eject the disk you just arrived from. The item removes itself at that start."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przełączenie się stąd zakłada na tym systemie jednorazowy wpis logowania. Wrócisz tu, a Change-Boot już stoi otwarty i gotowy wysunąć dysk, z którego przyszedłeś. Wpis zdejmuje się sam przy tym starcie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
