        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pomocnik nie jest zainstalowany."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same program answers to Terminal: list, current, switch, eject and log. It ends with an exit code, so a script can tell whether the switch worked. Install the command in Options, then type change-boot on its own — it shows your systems and the exact command to switch to each. change-boot help lists everything.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same program answers to Terminal: list, current, switch, eject and log. It ends with an exit code, so a script can tell whether the switch worked. Install the command in Options, then type change-boot on its own — it shows your systems and the exact command to switch to each. change-boot help lists everything."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ten sam program odpowiada w terminalu: list, current, switch, eject i log. Kończy się kodem wyjścia, więc skrypt pozna, czy przełączenie się udało. Zainstaluj polecenie w Opcjach, a potem wpisz samo change-boot — pokaże twoje systemy i gotowe polecenie do każdego z nich. Pełną listę daje change-boot help."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These apps did not close: %@.\n\nThey probably have unsaved work. Deal with them and switch again — the startup disk is already set.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These apps did not close: %@.\n\nThey probably have unsaved work. Deal with them and switch again — the startup disk is already set."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te programy się nie zamknęły: %@.\n\nPrawdopodobnie mają niezapisaną pracę. Zajmij się nimi i przełącz ponownie — dysk startowy jest już ustawiony."
          }
        }
      }
    },
